```java
int[] v = {2, 6, 5, 1, 5, 1};
int sum = 0;
int i = 0;
boolean found = false;
while (i < v.length && !found) {
    sum += v[i];
    if (sum > 12) {
        found = true;
    }
    i++;
}
System.out.println(i + " " + sum);
```

